 nline at pem.org In person at the Admissions desk Outside the museum on to
 ur days (161 Essex Street) This event occurs every Monday\, Thursday\, Fri
 day\, Saturday\, Sunday from Jul 2\, 2026 to Aug 31\, 2026. Time: 1:00pm 
 – 2:30pm and 2:00pm – 3:30pm Timezone: Eastern Time (US & Canada)\n\nS
