BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tuba Skinny
DTSTART:20260901T170000
DTEND:20260901T220000
DTSTAMP:20260830T154120Z
UID:961abe38311aa53fd8e2f0a53ae894@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Tuba Skinny\, the pride of New Orleans’ vibrant and fertile 
 trad jazz scene\, returns to Rockport for two shows! The beloved Crescent 
 City collective started out over a decade ago as show-stopping French Quar
 ter street buskers and have since turned into one of the greatest musical 
 ambassadors of New Orleans\, traveling the world with their spirited takes
  on Depression-era blues\, spirituals\, ragtime and traditional jazz. For 
 over a decade\, Tuba Skinny has grown steadily in popularity\, releasing t
 welve albums and touring all over the world. They’ve attracted a wide va
 riety of fans—young and old\, neophytes and niche-enthusiasts—with the
  strength of their musicianship and the scope of their jazz and American r
 oots music catalog. While they’ve become known as world-class interprete
 rs of traditional jazz\, over the years they’ve branched out into jug ba
 nd music\, spirituals\, country blues\, string band music\, ragtime\, and 
 New Orleans R&B. Their approach is a true reflection of Americana\, encomp
 assing the full genealogy of popular American music from an early 20th cen
 tury perspective. Despite a general lack of interest in social media and a
  limited release of their music online\, they’ve amassed an enthusiastic
  digital following. After a decade of playing (mostly) other artist’s so
 ngs\, Tuba Skinny decided to fulfill a long-time dream with the release of
  Magnolia Stroll—their first album of all-original tunes. Featuring comp
 ositions from Erika\, Shaye\, Robin\, Barnabus\, Craig\, and Max\, it is t
 heir love song to all the musicians\, living and dead\, who have inspired 
 them\, as well as to the neighborhoods of New Orleans that have nurtured t
 hem. Happens on the following Dates: Sep 1\, 2026\, 5:00pm to 7:00pm Timez
 one: Eastern Time (US & Canada) Sep 1\, 2026\, 8:00pm to 10:00pm Timezone:
  Eastern Time (US & Canada)\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https
 ://northofboston.org/event/tuba-skinny-2/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/tuba-skinny-2/
END:VEVENT
