BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Curator Conversation: Isamu Noguchi: “I am not a Designer”
DTSTART:20260919T130000
DTEND:20260919T140000
DTSTAMP:20260830T154120Z
UID:f402fc6cf65ae0c774736ae045036f@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join PEM curator Ruthie Dibble and High Museum of Art curators
  Monica Obniski and Marin Sullivan for a conversation celebrating the open
 ing of Isamu Noguchi: “I Am Not a Designer.” Learn how the exhibition 
 explores Noguchi’s boundary-defying practice through immersive installat
 ions\, archival materials and iconic works. The curators will discuss Nogu
 chi’s vision of unity among cultures\, people and the built environment
 \, as well as the collaborative process behind the exhibition.\n\nSources:
  North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/curator-conv
 ersation-isamu-noguchi-i-am-not-a-designer/
LOCATION:Peabody Essex Museum\, East India Square\, 161 Essex Street\, Sal
 em\, MA\, 01970
