DTSTAMP:20260830T154120Z
UID:ee07473e801c7b0be19ac6bf2d8378@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Boston’s Nutshell is the longest tenured Alice In Chains Tri
 bute Band in New England Established in 2005. They are five die hard Alice
  In Chains fans that deliver the sound\, harmonies and passion you see and
  hear from Alice In Chains. They have played every major venue and club in
  and around Boston and New England\, providing full electric sets as well 
 as recreations of the MTV Alice in Chains Unplugged album. They are as clo
 se to the REAL THING as you will get.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent p
 age: https://northofboston.org/event/grunge-fest-alice-in-chains-and-stone
 -temple-pilots-tribute-night/
