BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Prince of Darkness
DTSTART:20261010T200000
DTEND:20261010T220000
DTSTAMP:20260830T154120Z
UID:5227d0f1ca17f5d13fbb847be71c90@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night of pure heavy metal. Prince of Darkness:
  The Ultimate Ozzy Experience (formerly Wizard of Ozz) is an electrifying 
 tribute to Ozzy Osbourne\, bringing the legendary music of Ozzy and Black 
 Sabbath to life with incredible energy and musical precision. Featuring se
 asoned musicians whose careers were inspired by Ozzy’s iconic catalog\, 
 the band delivers faithful performances of classics like “Crazy Train\,
 ” “Bark at the Moon\,” “No More Tears\,” and “Paranoid.” Wit
 h powerful musicianship\, dynamic stage presence\, and impressive stage pr
 oduction\, Prince of Darkness recreates the excitement of a live Ozzy conc
 ert. Relive the power\, passion\, and unforgettable music that made Ozzy O
 sbourne one of heavy metal’s greatest icons. Thelarcom.org/princeofdarkn
 ess\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/eve
 nt/prince-of-darkness/
LOCATION:Larcom Theatre\, 13 Wallis Street\, Beverly\, MA\, 01915
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/prince-of-darkness/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Raul Midon at The Mahaiwe
DTSTART:20261010T173000
DTEND:20261010T190000
DTSTAMP:20260830T154120Z
UID:f4b047d17251b07ed8e1b1244dc5e2@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Grammy-nominated singer-songwriter and guitarist Raul Midón h
 as built a genre-defying career that blends soul\, jazz\, Latin rhythms\, 
 and acoustic virtuosity into a sound entirely his own. Blind since birth\,
  Midón has often been described as a one-man band – turning his guitar 
 into an orchestra and his voice into a chorus ( The New York Times ). His 
 artistry has earned praise from icons such as Quincy Jones (his music make
 s you smile)\, Elton John (who called State of Mind a soul classic)\, and 
 Bill Withers\, who championed his music.\n\nSources: The Berkshires\nEvent
  page: https://berkshires.org/events-old/raul-midon-at-the-mahaiwe/
LOCATION:Mahaiwe Performing Arts Center\, 14 Castle Street\, Great Barring
 ton\, MA\, 01230
URL:https://berkshires.org/events-old/raul-midon-at-the-mahaiwe/
END:VEVENT
