DTEND:20261022T203000
DTSTAMP:20260830T154120Z
UID:c7e369d72bd8942e26cab87ac1d2f8@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a virtual conversation and art making workshop fea
 turing the campy\, eerie talents of illustrator and artist Bill Crisafi. H
 ear him talk about his creative process and how he’s inspired by Salem\,
  and enjoy a hands-on art lesson. Crisafi was previously featured on the P
 EMcast\, the museum’s podcast. Listen to the episode now.\n\nSources: No
 rth of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/virtual-creativ
 e-foundations-bill-crisafi/
