BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tree of Life Wreath
DTSTART:20261024T110000
DTEND:20261024T140000
DTSTAMP:20260830T154120Z
UID:d020efa67527a2725765f13fede0c5@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:This special wreath—ideal for display inside your home–is 
 inspired by the well-known Shaker gift drawing “The Tree of Life” by H
 annah Cahoon. This gift drawing\, along with more than 25 others\, is part
  of the Hancock Shaker Village collection. The wreath is made with nautica
 l rope and a wire frame. You will have a choice to make a natural-looking 
 wreath with moss or a more whimsical one with reindeer moss and small red 
 flowers.\n\nSources: The Berkshires\nEvent page: https://berkshires.org/ev
 ents-old/tree-of-life-wreath/
LOCATION:Hancock Shaker Village\, 1843 West Housatonic Street\, Pittsfield
 \, MA\, 01201
URL:https://berkshires.org/events-old/tree-of-life-wreath/
END:VEVENT
