  holidays. The ornaments include an eight-pointed snowflake\; a puffy hear
 t\, woven in thin maple strips\; and a reindeer woven in dyed reed.\n\nSou
 rces: The Berkshires\nEvent page: https://berkshires.org/events-old/woven-
 holiday-ornaments/
LOCATION:Hancock Shaker Village\, 1843 West Housatonic Street\, Pittsfield
 \, MA\, 01201
URL:https://berkshires.org/events-old/woven-holiday-ornaments/
END:VEVENT
